  "description": "Boundary vectors for custos_toolkit.position.dust. The toolkit tests and the runner tests read this one file, so the two sides cannot drift apart on what counts as dust or how much a spot exit may sell. Quantities, prices and balances are canonical decimal strings; null means the value is not known.",
